+# Task 0.3 result receipt
+
+Date: 2026-09-29. Checkout: `/Users/poonszesen/kg-v3-codex`.
+Branch: `kg/rebuild-codex`. Starting commit:
+`559a3956b769200ed183ee7d42fa40f59b79b7f9`; initial worktree was clean.
+Scope and stopping condition: [brief](briefs/0.3.md). No training/evaluation,
+model-scale run, remote telemetry session or network request was performed.
+
+## Change inventory
+
+- `python/owl/train/logging.py`: keyword-only close exit code, W&B forwarding.
+- `python/owl/train/distributed.py`: rank-tagged, flushed traceback before teardown.
+- `scripts/run_ppo.py`: failure-aware logger context replaces unconditional closing.
+- `tests/owl/train/test_logging.py`: new offline logger interface regressions.
+- `tests/owl/train/test_distributed.py`: exception/interrupt ordering and cleanup.
+- `tests/scripts/test_run_ppo.py`: logger helper and actual runner exit codes.
+- `README.md`: mapped training behavior documentation.
+- Cookbook Reference `failed-training-reports-status-before-distributed-cleanup`,
+  references index and prepended log: current rebuild contract and evidence limits.
+- This receipt, brief, command inventory and adjacent logs: working evidence.
+
+## Checks
+
+All uv invocations use `UV_OFFLINE=1`; Cargo uses `CARGO_NET_OFFLINE=true`.
+Test stdout/stderr is preserved with `set -o pipefail` and `tee`.
+
